<view class="card">
  <view class="muted">RED CIRCLE · 红圈</view>
  <view class="heading">{{isEditing?'编辑会员资料':'从认识彼此开始'}}</view>
  <view class="muted" style="margin-top:16rpx;">{{isEditing?'选择你希望在社区展示的头像和昵称。':'用熟悉的微信头像和昵称，轻松加入红圈。'}}</view>
</view>
<view class="card">
 <view class="heading" style="font-size:34rpx;">{{isEditing?'我的头像与昵称':'创建会员档案'}}</view>
 <view class="avatar-field">
  <button class="avatar-button" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="onChooseAvatar">
   <image wx:if="{{avatarPreview}}" class="avatar" src="{{avatarPreview}}" mode="aspectFill"/>
   <view wx:else class="avatar-placeholder">+</view>
  </button>
  <view class="muted" style="margin-top:12rpx;">点击选择微信头像，也可从相册选择（选填）</view>
 </view>
 <form bindsubmit="onSubmit">
  <view class="field-title">会员昵称</view>
  <input class="nickname-input" name="nickname" type="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" maxlength="32" placeholder="点击可选择微信昵称，也可自行输入" bindinput="onNickname" bindblur="onNickname"/>
  <view class="muted" style="margin-top:16rpx;">头像、昵称均由你主动选择；不需要手机号或真实姓名。</view>
  <block wx:if="{{!isEditing}}">
   <checkbox-group bindchange="onConsent" style="margin-top:32rpx;">
    <label class="consent-line"><checkbox value="agreed" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#202B3C"/><text>我已阅读并同意以下会员注册说明</text></label>
   </checkbox-group>
   <view class="policy">我们会保存用于识别会员的微信账户标识、你主动选择的昵称和头像（如选择，将上传至红圈云存储）、注册确认记录，以及后续主动参与的社区活动与成长记录。用于会员身份识别、活动管理和会员资料展示。可向运营方申请查阅、更正或删除资料。头像为选填，不影响注册；不会自动获得管理员权限或积分。</view>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <button type="primary" form-type="submit" disabled="{{submitting}}" loading="{{submitting}}" style="margin-top:30rpx;">{{isEditing?'保存会员资料':'确认并加入红圈'}}</button>
 </form>
</view>
